\toc1 DHUWAṈḎJA BOKMANAWUY DHÄWU 
\toc2 Genesis 
\mt1 DHUWAṈḎJA BOKMANAWUY DHÄWU  
\ip Published by THE BIBLE SOCIETY IN AUSTRALIA Canberra  
\ip SUMMER INSTITUTE Of LINGUISTICS c/o P.O. BERRIMAH, DARWIN. N.T.  
\ip The Creation aṉḏ Flood Stories from Genesis 1-11 in Djambarrpuyngu  
\ip 690 Pages © B.S.A. 1981 470 copies  
\ip ISBN 0 647 12359 2  
\c 1  
\s1 Godthu bäpay bokmar bukmak nhä malany warrpam (The Story of Creation)  
\sr Genesis 1.1-31  
\p
\v 1 Ŋäthi Inydja ŋunhi, balanyamirriy ŋunhi yaka muka yan dhuwal wäŋa munathany maiŋ'thuna, God Waŋarr gan nhinan, ŋayipi waŋgany yan. Bala yan ŋayi Godthu bokmara dhuwal wäŋa munathany, ga gapu ga djiwarr'nha.  
\v 2 ŋunhi ŋayi ŋäthilnydja malŋ'thurr dhuwal munathany wäŋa buyuwuyu muka yan, ŋula nhämiriw muka, gapuy gan yan ŋapa-dhurrthurryurr. Ga munha'yiirr gan dhärranhany warrpam, munhay gan gungaŋal ŋunhiyi gapunhany. Ga wata gan marrtjin djiwatjiwa; ŋunhiyiny wata nhanŋuwuynha Godkun yan Walŋamirra Birrimbirr, wuŋi'wuŋijjyurrnydja gan ŋuliwitjarryi ŋapakurrnydja gapukurr.   
\p
\v 3 Bala ŋuliŋuryiny God waŋanan bitjarr, “Ma'! Badayala'yin!” bitjarr. Bala yuwalkthi badayala'yinan dhuwal wäŋany.  
\v 4 Bala ŋayi Godthu nhäŋalnha ŋunhiyi badayalany', bala manymak lakaraŋala. Bala yan ŋayi gänaŋ'maraŋala badayala'nhany beŋur buku-munhaŋurnydja,  
\v 5 bala ŋayi yäku nhirrpar munhanhany munhawun. Ga munhany djuḻkthurr, bala djaḏaw'yurr godarr'nha, ga ŋunhiyiny munha ŋurruŋu.   
\p
\v 6-7 Bala ŋayi Godtja waŋanan bitjarrnha, “Garrwarnydja dhu ga dhärra balanya nhakun bala'pala, bala dhu gapuny gulkmaranhamirra märrma'lila,” bitjarr. Bala yuwalkthin garrwarnydja maiŋ'thurra. Godthu djäma nhakun bala'palakuŋal, bala ŋayi gulkmaraŋal gapunhany, märrma'kuŋala, bala rulwaŋdhurr ḏiltji-ḏuwat bala'palaw, garrwar gal'ŋu, ga wiripuny gapu dhipal banydjiwal munatha'lil, ŋoylil bala'palalil.  
\v 8 Bala ŋayi Godthu yäku nhirrparnydja bala'palanhany garrwarnha. Ga munhany djuḻkthurr, bala djadaw'yurr goḏarr'nha, ga ŋunhiyiny wiripuŋuynha munhay,   
\p
\v 9 Bala God waŋan bitjarr, “Dhuwal gapu ŋunhi ga bulyun dhiyal munatha'ŋur, dhuwaṉḏja dhu yiwupthunna waŋganylila, märr dhu ga wäŋa ŋarakany dhärra baṉḏanynha yan,” bitjarr. Bala yan yuwalkthi ŋunhi majŋ'thurra munathany wäŋa, ga gapuny ŋunhi yiwupthurra waŋganylila.  
\v 10 Bala Godthuny yäku-nhirrparnha ŋarakany wäŋa munathan. Ga yiwupthunawuynydja gapu ŋayi yäku nhirrpar moŋuknha. Bala ŋayi goŋmirriyinan nhäŋalnydja ŋunhiyi nhanukiyinguŋ djämapuynydja, bala manymak lakaraŋalnha.  
\v 11 Bala ŋayi Godtja waŋan bitjarr, “Dhiyalnydja wäŋaŋur munatha'ŋur dhu ga dharrwan dharpany mala ŋuthan, borummirr dharpa ga mulmu malany maŋutjimirr.” Bala maḻŋ'thurra yan.  
\v 12 Yo, ga bukmaknha ŋunhi dharpany malany ŋutharnha dhiyal munatha'ŋurnydja, wiripuny ŋathamirra dharpa mala ga mulmu, ga wiripuny borummirriyinan dharpa mala. Bala ŋayi Godthuny goŋmirriyinan nhäŋalnydja, ŋamakurr lakaraŋala mirithinan.  
\v 13 Ga munhany djuḻkthurr, bala djaḏaw'yurra goḏarr'nha. Ga ŋunhiyiny bitjarryi wiripuŋuynha munhay.   
\p
\v 14 Bala ŋayi God waŋan bitjarr, “Baḏayalany' dhu ga dhärra garrwarnydja, märrma' yindi maṉḏany, bala gänaŋ'maraman maṉḏany dhu waluny ga munhany. Dhiyaŋuny dhu ga baḏayalay' lakaram, barrkuwatjkuman dhu ga maŋutji-lakaram waluny ga dhuŋgarrany ga ŋula nhaku malaŋuw buku-ḻuŋ'maranhaminyarawnha.” Bitjarr ŋayi God waŋanany.  
\v 15 “Bala maŋḏa dhu ga djeŋarra'yaman beŋur garrwarŋurnydja dhipal munatha'lilnydja.” Bala yan yuwalkthi maḻŋ'thurra.  
\v 16 Yo, bili Godthu bitjarryiny bokmar märrma' yindi baḏayala' maṉḏany; waluny ŋayi djäma walu-ŋupanaraw nhinanharaw, ga ŋaḻindiny ŋayi djäma munha-ŋupanaraw nhinanharaw, ga bulu ganyuny ŋayi djämayi.  
\v 17 Ŋayi nhirrparnydja ŋunhiyi malany garrwarlil, märr walal dhu ga baḏayala'kum räli munatha wäŋa,  
\v 18 yan badayala'kunharaw walu-ŋupanaraw ga munha-ŋupanaraw, nhakun gänaŋ'maram ga waluny beŋur munhawuŋur. Bala ŋayi Godthu goŋmirriyinan nhäŋalnydja ŋunhiyi nhanukiyinguŋ djämapuynydja, bala manymak lakaraŋala ŋayi.  
\v 19 Ga munhany djuḻkthurr, bala djaḏaw'yurra goḏarr'nha. Ga ŋunhiyiny bitjarryi wiripuŋuynha munhay.   
\p
\v 20 Bala ŋayi God waŋan bitjarr, “Dharrwan dhu ga guyany mala ŋorra, ga ŋula nhäny mala ŋunhiliyi gapuŋurnydja, ga wäyin dhu ga buṯthunna ŋula garrwarkurrnydja,” bitjarr.  
\v 21 Bala yuwalkthi ŋunhi maḻŋ'thurrnydja ŋunhiyiny mala. Godthu bitjarryi bokmar ŋunhiyiny mala. Godthu bitjarryi bokmar dilkurrunhany gal'ŋu guyany, ga yumurrku mala, ga wiripuŋuny ga wiripuŋuny nhä mala ŋunhi ga ŋorra gapuŋur; ga bulu wäyinnha ŋayi bokmaryi wiripu ga wiripu mala buṯthunamirriny. Bala ŋayi goŋmirriyinan nhäŋalnydja ŋunhiyi nhanukiyinguŋ djämapuynydja, bala ŋayi manymak lakaraŋalnha.   
\p
\v 22 Bala ŋayi Godtja waŋanan, nhakun goŋmirriyaŋala walalany, “Nhuma nhä malany ŋunhi nhuma ga nhina gapuŋur, nhumany dhu bulun dharrwathirr, dhaŋaŋdhirra dhu bulun gapuŋurnydja. Ga nhuma warrakan mala buṯthunamirr dhu bitjaṉḏhi bili mala-bunhamirr, dharrwathirr dhu bulun malany,” bitjarr ŋayi God waŋanany.  
\v 23 Ga munhany djuḻkthurr, bala djaḏaw'yurr goḏarr'nha. Ga ŋunhiyiny bitjarryi wiripuŋuynha munhay.   
\p
\v 24 Bala ŋayi God waŋan bitjarr, “Dhiyal munatha'ŋurnydja dhu ga nhina wiripu wiripu warrakan mala, yutjuwaḻa warrakan ga ḏilkurr, goŋmirr ga wakinŋu warrakan,” bitjarr. Bala yuwalkthin ŋunhi bitjarryiny maḻŋ'thurrnydja.  
\v 25 Yo, Godthu bitjarryi bokmarnydja bawalamirra warrakan'nhany malaŋuny, yumurrkuny ga ḏilkurruny. Bala ŋayi Godthuny goŋmirriyinan nhäŋalnydja ŋunhiyi nhanukiyinguŋ djämapuy, bala manymak lakaraŋala.   
\p
\v 26 Ga ŋuliŋuryiny dhurrwaraŋur ŋunhi ŋayi bokmar nhä malany, bala ŋayi God waŋan bitjarrnha, “Dhiyaŋuny bala limurr dhu dhuwal djäma yolŋunhan; yurr ḻiyamirra ŋayiny dhu, balanyan nhakun limurruwuy, märr ŋayi dhu ga guyaŋan ga mala-djarr'yunna. Ŋilimurr dhu nhirrpaṉḏja yolŋuwala goŋlilnydja bukmak ŋunhi nhä mala ŋarrakuŋ bokmanawuy, guya ga warrakan mala, buṯthuna-mirriny ga marrtjinyamirriny ga gaḻ'yunamirriny warrakan'nha, goŋmirriny ga wakinŋuny, ḏilkurruny ga yumurrkuny; bukmak yan dhu dhuwaliyi warrakan'tja mala yolŋuwala djägaŋur,” bitjarr Godtja waŋan.   
\p
\v 27 Bala ŋayi Godthuny djäma yolŋunhan; ŋayi ŋanya djämany yolŋunhany ḻiyamirryaŋal, bitjarr bili nhakun ŋayipi, märr ŋayi dhu ga guyaŋan ga mala-djarr'yunna. Djämany ŋayi yolŋunhany maṉḏany, ḏirramuny ga miyalknha.  
\v 28 Bala ŋayi God waŋanan maṉḏaŋgal, goŋmirryaŋala manapar maṉḏany, “Nhumalaŋguŋuny dhu mala-bunhawuy dharrwan mirithirra djamarrkuḻiny', märr walal dhu ga nhumalaŋguŋ mala-bunhamirra, ḻatjuwarr'yunna dhu wäŋalila malaŋulil, bawalamirrilila, bala walalnha dhu ga goŋdhuny ŋayatham wäŋanhany dhuwal munatha'nhany. Ga bitjaṉḏhi bili ŋarra nhumalany ga yolŋu'-yulŋunhany waṉa-nhirrpaṉḏhi bukmakku warrakan'ku malaŋuw ŋunhi ga marrtji'-marrtji gapukurr ga munatha'kurr ga garrwarkurr.”   
\p
\v 29 Ga bulu God waŋan maṉḏaŋgal, rom nhirrpar yolŋuwalnydja maṉḏaŋgal bitjarr, “Rulwaŋdhurrnydja ŋarra dhuwal borumdja mala wiripu wiripu ga ŋathany nhumalaŋ yolŋu'-yulŋuwnydja Jukanharaw,  
\v 30 yurr warrakan'kuny yumurrkuw ga ḏilkurruw ga buṯthunamirriw warrakan'ku ŋarra rulwaŋdhurr dharpapuy marwat ga mulmu walalaŋguny ŋatha.” Bala yuwalkthin majŋ'thurra gan.   
\p
\v 31 Ga Godthu nhäŋalnydja ŋunhiyi warrpam' nhä mala ŋayi djäma, bala ŋayi märr-ŋamathinan nhäŋalnydja, manymak lakaraŋala. Ga ŋunhiyiny bitjarryi wiripuŋuynha munhay.   
\c 2  
\s1  
\sr Genesis 2.1-4  
\p
\v 1 Yo, Godthu bokmarnydja dhuwal wäŋa munathany ga djiwarr, ga bukmak nhä mala marrtji ŋorra dhiyal munatha'ŋur ga gapuŋur ga djiwarr'ŋur; djämany ŋayi bukmak dhawar'maraŋala.   
\p
\v 2 Ga munhany djuḻkthurr, bala djaḏaw'yurr goḏarr'nha, ga ŋuriŋiyiny waluy ŋayi God nhinanan, ḏaḏawyurra djämaŋur, bili nhanŋu djämany bilin dhawar'yurra.  
\v 3 Godthu djäma ŋunhi ḻurrkun' ga ḻurrkun' munha, bala wiripuŋuynydja munhay ŋayi nhinanan, djäman nhanŋu dhawar'yurr. Bala ŋayi God marrkapthurra ŋurikiyiny waŋganyguny waluw, bala yan gänaŋ'maraŋala, gänan ŋunhiyiny waŋganydja walu nhinanhamirra ŋurikalyiny waŋgany-goŋgalnydja ga waŋgany bäythinyawuywal, bili ŋuriŋiyiny waluy ŋayi dadawyurra djämaŋur, bili nhanukuŋ nhä mala bokmanawuy warrpam' ganan, dhawar'yurra.   
\p
\v 4 Ga bitjarryiny gan ŋunhi dhuwal wäŋa maḻŋ'thurr, munatha ga gapu ga djiwarr', ga bukmak nhä mala ŋunhi marrtji ŋorra dhika.  
\s1 Godthu Garrayyu djäma ŋurruŋuny yolŋuny maṉḏany ḏirramuny ga miyalknha nhanŋu (The Creation of Adam and Eve)  
\sr Genesis 2.4-25  
\p Yo, Godthu ŋäthilnydja djäma wäŋa munatha dhuwal, ga bukmak ŋunha ŋorra marrtji garrwar.  
\v 5 Ŋunhi ŋayi ŋäthilnydja djäma dhuwal munathany wäŋa, dhuwaṉḏja munathany wäŋa ŋula nhämiriw muka, mulmumiriw ga dharpamiriw ga ŋathamiriw, bili yaka muka yan ganha ŋula nhäny mala ŋuthanha, bili Godthu yaka muka yan djuy'yuna waltjaṉdja dharyunarawnydja munathaw, ga yaka ganha nhinanha yolŋuw ŋula djämaw, ŋuthanmaranharaw.  
\v 6 Yo, yaka muka yan waltjaṉdhuny ganha dharyuna, yurr ŋunhi gapuny ŋuwapthurr beŋur munatha'ŋur djinawa'ŋur, bala djurruknha gan dhärran dhuwal munathany' wäŋa.   
\p
\v 7 Bala ŋayi Garrayyu Godthu djäman yolŋunhan; dhiṯthurrnydja ŋayi munatha djurruk, bala djäman yolŋukuŋala, rumbalkuŋala yolŋunhan djäma, bala ŋayi Godthu bo'yurra nhanukal ŋurrulila, nhanukiyinguŋun ŋayi walŋa gurrupar, walŋamirra wata, bo-o-oy' bitjarryi nhanukal, bala yan ŋayi yolŋuny ŋunhi walŋathinan yolŋuthinan.   
\p
\v 8 Bala ŋayi Godthu djäma retjan, ŋunha bala gali-dhimurruŋur; ga yäkuny ŋunhi retjany Yedan. Bala ŋayi nhirrparnydja Godthu ŋunhiyin yolŋunhany ŋunhi ŋayi djäma ŋanya. Nhirrparnydja ŋayi ŋanya Godthuny ŋunhiwiliyin retjalilnydja.   
\p
\v 9 Ga ŋunhiliyiny retjaŋur ŋayi djäma dharrwan mirithirra dharpany mala, wiripu wiripun dharpany mala manymakmirra dhika, ga wiripu borummirr dharpa. Ga ŋunhiwili retjalil ṉapuŋgalilnydja ŋayi Godthu nhirrpar märrma' dharpa maṉḏany, gänaŋ'thunna ga mayali'mirra ŋunhiyin dharpa maṉḏany, gänan gan dhärran ṉapuŋgany. Waŋganydja ŋunhi dharpa yäku Walŋa-gurrupanamirr, ga wiripuny ŋunhi dharpa yäku Marŋgi-gurrupanamirr; ŋuli dhu ŋula yolthu yolŋuy ḻukany ŋuliŋuryi dharpaŋur borumdja, Marŋgi-gurrupanamirriŋurnydja, ŋayiny dhu ŋuriŋiyiny yolŋuyhydja dharaŋanna yätjkurrunhan romnha ga ŋamakulinhan.   
\p
\v 10 Ga ŋuliwitjaṉḏhi retjakurr marrtji ŋorra gapu mayaŋ; ga ŋuliŋuryi ŋuriŋi gapuy ŋuli ganha ŋuthanmaranha, walŋakunha ŋunhiyi retjany. Waṉḏinan gan ŋunhiyi mayaŋdja, ga yan bili-i-i ga dhawaṯthurrnydja ŋuliŋur retjaŋur, ŋunhalnha bala barrkuwatjthinan, ḏämbumiriwyinany mayaŋdja ŋunhal warraŋulnha.  
\v 11 Waŋganydja ŋunhi mayaŋ yäku Bitjun, yurr ŋunhiyi mayaŋdja ŋuli ganha ḻiw'maranha waṉḏinya wäŋakurr yäkukurr Yapilakurr.  
\v 12 Ŋunhiyiny wäŋaŋur ga ŋorra buthalakthinya guṉḏa, bulu miḻ'milŋdhunan, ga wiripun guṉḏa miny'tji mii'miḻŋdhunayi yan, bulun mel-wiḏi'mirra guṉḏa, ga bulu walal ŋuli ga weyika märram buŋgan baw' ŋunhiliyiny wäŋaŋur.  
\v 13 Ga wiripuny mayaŋ marrtji ŋorra ḻiw'maraman wäŋakurr yäkukurr Gutjkurra, yurr yäkuny ŋunhiyi mayaŋdja Giy.un.  
\v 14 Ga wiripuny mayaŋ yäku Daykurutja ŋorra marrtji Mw'maram Yätjiriyakurr wäŋakurr, yurr gali-dhimurrukurra. Ga wiripuny mayaŋ yäku ŋunhiyi Yipuraytitj.   
\p
\v 15 Yo. Garrayyu djäma ŋunhiyiny wäŋa retjamirriyaŋalnydja, yäku Yedaṉḏja, bala ŋayi nhirrparnydja ŋunhiyin ḏirramunhan ŋunhiwiliyiny retjalil, märr ŋayi dhu ga nhina ŋunhiliyi manymakŋur wäŋaŋur, ga djäman ŋuthanmaraman, ga djägan ŋayi dhu ga ŋurikiyi retjaw.  
\v 16 Bala ŋayi Godthu lakaraŋala nhanukal, ŋurikalyiny ḏirramuwal, romnha nhirrpar guyaŋanharawnha yolŋuwnha, ga bitjarr ŋayi Godthu rom-lakaraŋalnydja waŋanany gam', “Ḻukany nhuma dhu ga bawalamirriwuy dharpapuynydja borumdja malany dhuwal dhärra marrtji gätniŋur,  
\v 17 yurr waŋganybuynydja dharpapuy nhuma dhu yakany ḻuka. Yakan yan nhuma dhu ḻuka ŋuliŋurnydja Marŋgi-gurrupanamirriŋurnydja dharpaŋur. Ŋuli dhu ŋula yolthu yolŋuy ḻukany ŋuliŋuryiny dharpaŋur borum, Marŋgi-gurrupanamirriŋurnydja, ŋayiny dhu ŋuriŋiyiny yolŋuy dharaŋanna yätjkurrunhany romnha, ga ŋamakulinhany. Ŋuli nhe dhu märr-yuḻkthundja ŋarrany dhäruktja bala ḻukan ŋunhiŋuwuydhi dharpapuy ŋunhi ŋarra yaka'yurr, nheny dhu bäyŋuthirra, bitjanna nhakun dhiŋgaman nhe dhu.” Ga bitjarr ŋayi God waŋan, rom-lakaraŋalnydja ŋurikiyi yolŋuw, guyaŋanharawnydja nhanŋu.   
\p
\v 18 Bala ŋayi Garray waŋan bitjarrnha, “Yakan dhuwal manymak waŋganyguny yolŋuw nhinanharaw, ŋayi dhu ga nhina gänany. Ŋarra dhu dhuwal djäma marrparaŋnha marrparaŋgunharaw muka nhanŋu, bämara' nhanŋu guŋga'yunaraw,” bitjarr.   
\p
\v 19 Bala ŋayi Godthu dhiṯthurr beŋur munathan, bala ŋayi djäma warrakan'kuŋala, bukmaknha yan warrakan'nha mala, marrtjinyamirriny ga gai'yunamirriny ga buṯthunamirriny. Djämany ŋayi walalany Godthu, warrpam'thurr yan, bala gäŋalnha ŋurikal yolŋuwalnha, märr ŋayi dhu nhäma'-nhama, bala yäku-nhirrpanna marrtji, märr dhu warrakan mala waŋga'waŋgany ŋunhi yäkumirr ŋurukuŋdhi dirramuwuŋ.  
\v 20 Bala ŋayi ŋuriŋi dirramuynydja yäku-nhirrpara marrtjin bukmaknhan warrakan'nha, bodinynha ga wakinŋuny, ga buṯthunamirriny warrakan'nha; yurr yaka ŋayi waŋganynha ŋula maḻŋ'maranha ḻundu'mirriŋunhany, marrparaŋdja nhanŋuwuy ŋayi.   
\p
\v 21 Bala ŋayi Godthu ŋunhi ḏirramunhany buku-dhumukkuŋalnha yorrkuŋalnydja, bala ŋayi Godthu ḏirramuwalnha gali'ŋur ŋarakany djaw'yurr djamurr, bala ŋayi balayi buyuwuyukuŋal barrwan'tja ŋanya ŋunhiyi yolŋunhany.  
\v 22 Bala ŋayi Godthu djäma miyalknhan; ŋayi märraŋalnydja djamurr beŋur ḏirramuwal gali'ŋur, bala rumbalkuŋalnha djäma, miyalknhan rumbal.  
\p Bala ŋayi Godthu gäŋalnha ŋunhiyi miyalknhany balan ḏirramuwalnha.  
\v 23 Bala ŋayi ŋuriŋi ḏirramuynydja nhäŋalnha ŋanya, bala ŋayi yoraŋala bitjarrnha, “Dhuwal dhuḏi-yapalany yolŋun yan, ga ḻiyamirr balanya bili muka nhakun ŋarrapi yan; ŋarrapin yan dharaŋanan. Nhanŋuny ŋunha ŋaraka dhipuŋur yan ŋarrakuŋ, ga ŋaṉaktja nhanŋu ŋunha dhipuŋuryi yan ŋarrakuŋ. Ŋarra dhu dhuwal yäku nhirrpaṉḏja ŋanya miyalknha, bili Godthu ŋanya djaw'yurr dhipuŋur yan ŋarrakuŋ ḏirramuwuŋ.”   
\p
\v 24 Manymak. Maṉḏa ḏirramu ga miyalk nhanŋu waŋganyŋura maṉḏa rumbalnydja. Ga dhiyakun ŋayaŋuw, ŋunhi ŋuli ḏirramu ga miyalk märranhamirrnydja, bala ŋayi ŋuli ḏirramuny gänaŋ'thuna ŋäṉḏi'mirriŋuwalnydja nhanukalaŋuwal ga bäpa'mirriŋuwalnydja, bala ŋayi ŋuli ḏirramuny ḏhä-manapana nhanukalaŋuwalnha miyalkkalnha, märr maṉḏa ŋuli waŋganydhirra, ga ḻundu'manydjin, ga marrparaŋdhinyamirra maṉḏaŋguwuy maṉḏa.  
\v 25 Yo, ŋunhiyi yolŋu maṉḏa ŋurruŋu ḏirramu ga miyalk, yurr bäyŋu maṉḏa ŋunhi girri'mirrnydja, warraŋul maṉḏa ŋunhiyi, ga djolarra; yurr goramiriwnha maṉḏaŋguwuy maṉḏa yulŋuny.   
\c 3  
\s1 Yolŋuny maṉḏa ŋunhi buthuru-djaw'yunmin Garraywu, bala gärrinan yätjkurrulilnydja romlil (The Disobedience of Man)  
\sr Genesis 3.1-24  
\p
\v 1 Yo. Godthu ŋunhi djäma bukmaknha warrakan'nhany mala ŋäthil, yurr waŋganynhany ŋunhi ŋayi djäma ŋuliŋuryi malaŋur bulun gaḏamannha, mayali'-dharrwanhan, yurr yäkuny ŋayi ŋunhiyi Moḻ'ŋu.  
\p Waŋganymirr ŋunhiyi miyalk marrtjin, bala ŋayiny ŋunhi Moḻ'ŋuny bunanan nhanŋu, ŋuriki miyalkku, bala waŋanan ŋanya, bitjarrnha dhä-birrka'yurrnydja gam': “Way! Godtja nhumalaŋ yaka'yurr muka?...dhiyakuny gay'yi borumguny malaŋuw ḻukanharaw?...ŋunhi marrtji ŋorra dhuwal retjaŋur?” bitjarr.   
\p
\v 2 Bala ŋayiny ŋunhi miyalktja waŋan bitjarr, “Dhuwal dharrwa borumdja bawalamirriŋur dharpaŋur ḻukanharawnydja,  
\v 3 yurr dhiyakuny gay'yi, waŋganyguny dharpaw ŋayi God waŋan yaka'yurr bitjarr gam': 'Ŋuli nhe dhu ḻuka dhipuŋuryiny dharpaŋur borum, ga yan ŋayathamany dhuwal dharpany, nheny dhu dhiŋgaman,' bitjarr.” Ga bitjarr ŋayiny miyalkthuny lakaraŋal.   
\p
\v 4 Bala ŋayiny waŋan ŋunhi Moḻ'ŋuny bitjarr, “Yaw! Dhuwaliny yaka yuwalk! Nyäḻ'yurr warray muka?” bitjarr. “Yaka nhe dhu dhiŋgam. Dhuwaṉḏja manymak borum.  
\v 5 Ŋayin ŋunhi Godnha nhumalaŋ yaka'yurrnydja bitjarryiny, bili ŋayi ga dharaŋan dhuwalatjaṉḏhin ŋunhi nhe dhu ḻukany, nheny dhu dharaŋana, bulun dhu gaḏamaṉḏhirr, bitjan nhakun God ŋayipi yan. Ŋuli nhe dhu ḻukany, nheny dhu mirithirra dharaŋan bukmaknhan romnha, ŋamakulinhan romnha, ga djarrpi'nhan.” Ga bitjarr ŋayi ŋuriŋiyi Moḻ'ŋuy lakaraŋal ŋurikal miyalkkalnydja.   
\p
\v 6 Bala ŋayi ŋuriŋi miyalkthuny nhäŋala gan rumbi'yurra ŋunhiyi borumdja, bala nhanukal maŋutjiŋurnydja manymakthinan ŋunhiyi borumdja, bala ŋayi yan ŋoy-ŋapu'yurra, märr ŋayi dhu bulun gadamaṉḏhirr ḻiya. Bala ŋayi gulkthurra ŋunhiyi borumdja, bala ḻukanan. Ḻukanany ŋayi, bala ŋayi wiripuny gurrupar nhanukiyingalaŋuwnha ŋayi dhuway'mirriŋuwnha, bala ŋayiny muka ḻukan.   
\p
\v 7 Yo. Ga ŋunhiyi maŋda ḻukanany, märr-yuḻkthurra manapar Godnhan ŋunhi ŋayi waŋan maṉḏaŋgal yaka'yurr ḻukanharaw ŋurikiyi borumgu. Ga dhunupan dhurrwaraŋur ḻukanhaŋurnydja maṉḏany dharaŋarnha; nhänhaminany maṉḏa warraŋulnha, bala goranan maṉḏaŋguwuy maṉḏa. Bala maṉḏa gulkmaraŋalnha marwaṯnha dharpany bala djäman girrin' dhurrthurryunminyarawnha maṉḏaŋguwuy maṉḏa.   
\p
\v 8 Ga balanyamirriyyin munhawun maṉḏa ŋäkula Godnhan rirrakay, ŋayi gan marrtjin ŋuliwitjarryi retjakurr. Ŋäkulnydja maṉḏa, bala waṉḏinan djuḻuḻ'yurra nhanukal, retjalila gulŋiyin.  
\v 9 Yurr ŋayiny Garraynydja wäthurr nhanŋu ḏirramuwnydja bitjarr, “Way, wanha dhika nhe yulŋuny?”   
\p
\v 10 Bala ḏirramuny waŋanan buku-roŋanmaraŋalnha bitjarr, “Dhuwal ŋarra. Ŋäkul warray nhuna ŋarra rirrakaynydja, bala ŋarra barrarinan nhuŋu, bala waṉḏinan ŋarra djuḻuḻ'yurra nhokalaŋuŋur, bili warraŋulnha ŋarra dhuwal yulŋuny,” bitjarr.   
\p
\v 11 “Yo yoy! Yolthu nhuŋu dhuwal lakaraŋal warraŋulthinyarawnydja?” bitjarr ŋayi God waŋan ŋurikal ḏirramuwal. “Dhuwaṉḏja nhe ŋunhiyin borumnha ḻukan muka?...ŋunhi ŋarra nhuŋu yaka'yurr ŋurikiyi ḻukanharaw?” bitjarr.   
\p
\v 12 Ga ŋayiny ḏirramuny buku-bakmaraŋal Godku bitjarr, “Ŋuruŋ dhuwal miyalkthu ŋarraku gurrupar, ŋunhi nhe djäma ŋanya ŋarraku. Ŋayi ŋarrany gurrupar, bala ŋarrany yurrnha ḻukan,” bitjarr.   
\p
\v 13 Ga buluny ŋayi waŋan Garray ŋunhi miyalknhan, “Nhaku nhe ŋunhi goŋ-djarryurrnydja?” bitjarr. Ga ŋayiny maŋutji-gäŋal ŋanyanhan ŋunhi Moḻ'ŋunhan, “Ŋuruŋ dhuwal ŋarrany mayali'-gäŋal Moḻ'ŋuy, bala ŋarra ḻukanan,” bitjarr.   
\p
\v 14 Bala ŋayi Godthu waŋan Moḻ'ŋunhany bitjarr gam', “Ŋarrany nhuna dhu dhuwal dhä-gir'yunna, bili nhe bitjarryi dhuwal. Nhepi dhu ga yan nhina buku-munha'ŋurnydja, wakuluŋgul'mirriŋurnydja romŋur, nhepi waŋgany yan. Dhipuŋurnydja dhurrwaraŋur nhe dhu djuryunna waṉḏirra, dhulmuynha nhokiyingal nhe. Ga ŋathany nhuŋu ḻukanharawnydja dhukun yan.  
\v 15 Ga nhumalaŋguny dhu ga nhuŋu ga yolŋuwnydja miyalkku marin yan dhärra; nhokuŋ djamarrkuḻi' ga yolŋuwuŋ djamarrkuḻi' dhu ga bunhamirra yan. Yolŋuynydja nhuna dhu muḻkurr wuṯthun, binydjitjkum, ga nheny dhu ŋanya ḻäwum ḻuku,” ga bitjarr ŋayi God waŋan Moḻ'ŋunhany.   
\p
\v 16 Bala ŋayi bilyurra Godtja, ga waŋan miyalknhany bitjarra gam': “Dhipuŋurnydja dhurrwaraŋur nheny dhu galŋa-yätjirra yothuwalnha gänharay rerriy, ga ŋuliwitjaṉḏja ŋunhi dhu yothu dhawal-guyaŋa, bala nheny dhu mirithirra rirrikthun. Yurr bäydhi, nheny dhu ga djälthirr yan nhokalaŋaw nhe dhuway'mirriŋuwnydja. Ga ŋayin dhu ŋurruŋun nhuŋu.”  
\v 17 Ga ŋuliŋurnydja ŋayi God waŋan ŋurikalnha ḏirramuwalnha, yäkuny ŋayi ŋunhiyi Adam, ga bitjarr ŋayi God waŋanany nhanŋuny gam', “Nheny märraŋal warray nhuŋuwuy nhe miyalknha dhäruk, bala ḻukanan ŋunhiyi, ŋunhi ŋarra waŋan yaka'yurr ŋurikiyi. Bili nhe bitjarryiny buthuru-djaw'yunminan ŋarrakalaŋuwnha dhärukku, dhuwaṉḏja dhu munathany wäŋa mariynha monygum, wakuluŋgul-mirriyirra dhu. Nhe dhu ga djämany mirithirra yan, bitjanna bili nhe dhu djämany ga mirithirra, ŋuthanmaramany nhuŋuwuy nhe ŋathanhany, gänan nhuŋuwuynha nhe,  
\v 18 bili nhäŋiniŋ'nha ga ŋula nhäny mulmun dhu ga ŋuthaṉḏja munatha'ŋurnydja, mei-manapanmirra. Ga ŋunhan diltjipuynha ŋathany nhe dhu ga ḻukany.  
\v 19 Yo, djämany nhe dhu mirithirra yan, galŋa-ŋundurr'yundja, munatha'nhany buḻŋu'kum djäma, märr dhu ga ŋunhiliyi munatha'ŋur ŋatha mala ŋuthanna. Djämany nhe dhu ga-a-a, yan bili-i-i ga dhiŋgam nhe dhu, balayi munatha'yirryi. Yo. Bili ŋarra nhuna djämany beŋur munatha'ŋur, ga balayi nhe dhu munatha'yirryi.”  
\p Ga bitjarr ŋayi God waŋanany lakaraŋalnydja dhä-gir'yunarawnydja, bili maṉḏa bitjarryiny ŋunhi buthuru-djaw'yunminany, bala gärrinan yätjkurrulila romlil.   
\p
\v 20 Bala ŋayi ḏirramuynydja yäku nhirrpar nhanŋuwuy ŋayi miyalknha Evenha, bili ŋayiny ŋunhi ŋäŋdi'mirriŋu bukmakkun ŋilimurruŋgun yolŋu'yulŋuwnha, dhiyakun dhuwal ga nhina bukmak-ŋur wäŋaŋur ḻiw'maraman.   
\p
\v 21 Ga ŋuliŋuryiny ŋayi Godthu bumar warrakan'nha, bala yan märraŋala barrwaŋ'tja, bala djäma girrin' maṉḏaŋ, dhurrthurryunaraw Adamgu ga nhanu-kalaŋuw miyalkku.   
\p
\v 22 Ga ŋuliŋuryiny dhurrwaraŋur God waŋan bitjarr, “Dhiyaŋiyiny ga ḏirramuy dharaŋanna dhiyaŋuny bala, bitjanna nhakun ŋilimurrnha, marŋgin ŋayiny yätjkurruw ga ŋamakuliw romgu. Bala dhipuŋurnydja dhurrwarŋur ŋayi dhu ga yolŋu bäyŋu nhina walŋa-weyindja, gupaḏalnydja; yakan ŋayi dhu ḻuka ŋunhiyi Walŋa-gurrupanamirrinhany borumnha.”  
\v 23 Bala ŋayi Godthuny djuy'yurra dhawatmaraŋala ŋanya ŋunhiyi ḏirramunhany beŋur retjaŋurnydja, ga ŋunna gali'ŋura ŋayi gan djämany munathany ŋunhi ŋayi maḻŋ'thurr beŋuryi munatha'ŋur.   
\p
\v 24 Yo. Godthu ŋaŋ'ŋaŋdhurra yolŋunhany maṉḏany, dhawatmaraŋala ŋuliŋur retjaŋumydja Yedanŋur. Bala ŋayi Godthu nhirrparnydja djiwarr'puynhan yolŋunhany ŋunhiwiliyiny dhurrwaralilnydja retjalil gali-dhimurruŋurnydja, gunganharaw ŋurikiyiny retjawnydja. Ŋayi gan dhärranhany ŋunhiyi djiwarr'puynydja yolŋu goŋ-yiki'mirr, yurr yikiny' ŋunhi balanyan nhakun ŋäṉarr gurtha, bitjanan bili ŋuli ganha djaḻkarr'yunan bala rälin, märr dhu yakan ŋula yol yolŋu marrtjiny ŋuliwitjaṉḏhi, ga yakan dhu ŋula yol galkithirr ŋurikalyiny dharpawal Walŋa-gurrupanamirriwalnydja.   
\c 4  
\s1 Cain ga Abel (Cain aṉḏ Abel)  
\sr Genesis 4.1-16  
\p
\v 1 Dhäŋur djuy'yunaŋurnydja ŋunhi maṉḏany ŋayi Godthu ŋäthil djuy'yurr beŋur gätniŋurnydja, bala maṉḏa balanyamirriyyiny waluy märranhaminan Adam ga nhanŋu miyalk, bala ŋayi miyalktja yothu-mirriyinan. Bala nhanŋu yothuny ḏirramu dhawal-guyaŋanan, bala ŋayi miyalktja waŋan bitjarrnha, “Dhuwaṉḏja ŋarraku ḏirramu yothu dhawal-guyaŋan beŋur Garraywuŋ guŋga'yunawuy.” Bala ŋayi yäku-nhirrparnydja ŋanya Cainnha.   
\p
\v 2 Ga dhäŋur beŋuryiny ŋayi dhawal-guyaŋan wiripun ḏirramu yothu nhanukuŋ miyalkkuŋ, yäku Abelnha. Ga ŋunhi maṉḏa yothuny maṉḏa yindithinany, bala maṉḏa djämany märraŋalnha. Ga Abelnydja yolŋu yäku wäyin-djägamirr, ga Caindja yäku yolŋu gätni-djämamirr.   
\p
\v 3 Ŋula nhämunha' walu djuḻkthurr, ga ŋula nhätha yalalan dhä-dhuḏitjnha, bala ŋayiny Caindhuny gäŋalnha borum mala Godku mundhurr, ŋunhi nhanukiyinguŋ ŋuthanmaranhawuy, bala gurruparnha.  
\v 4 Ga ŋayiny Abelyuny märraŋal warrakan yothu ŋunhi ŋayi ŋuli ganha djäga ŋurikiyi warrakan'ku malaŋuw, yurr ŋurruŋuwuynha dhawal-guyaŋanhawuy-nydja ŋayi märraŋal, bala ŋayi wuṯthurra, bala gurrupara nhanŋu Godku mundhurrnydja, yurr gurrupar-nydja ŋayi Abelyu ŋunhin malany ŋunhi nhän mala nhanukal Abelwal ŋayaŋuŋur. Bala Godtja nhanŋu Abelwu mirithinan ŋoy-djulŋithin ga ŋuriki mundhurrwu nhanukalaŋaw,  
\v 5 yurr Cainguŋuny ŋayi mundhurr gumurr-dhar'yurr ganarrthaŋala Godthu.  
\p Bala ŋayi Caindja mirithinan maḏakarritjthin, ga bukuny ŋayi mirithinan wiripuŋuyin mariynydja nhanukiyingal ŋayi.  
\v 6 Bala ŋayi Garraynydja waŋan Cainguny bitjarrnha, “Nhaku nhe dhuwal maḏakarritjthinany? Ga bukuny nhe wiripuŋuyin mariynydja nhokiyingal nhe?  
\v 7 Ŋuli nhe balaŋ djäma dhunupany, nheny balaŋ ŋoy-gitkiṯthunan. Yan nhe djäma djarrpi'kuŋal warray, bala nhuŋu ga yätjkurrnydja galkunna ŋayathanharawnha. Ŋayi djäl nhuŋu yätjkurr ŋurruŋuyinyaraw, ŋayi nhuŋu dhu ŋurruŋuyirr. Ga nheny ŋanya dhu ga mirithirr yan djuḻkmaram.”   
\p
\v 8 Ga Caindja waŋan yukuyuku'mirriŋuwalnydja Abelwalnydja bitjarr, “Go ŋali marrtjin ḏiltjilila.” Ga ŋunhi maṉḏa dhuwaṯthurrnydja ḏiltjililnydja, bala ŋayi Caindja gumurr-bilyurra bala wuṯthurra Abelnhany rakunygun.   
\m
\v 9 Bala Garrayyuny dhä-birrka'yurrnha Cainnhany bitjarrnha, “Cain, wanha nhuŋu yukuyuku'mirriŋuny Abelnydja?” bitjarr. Bala ŋayi Caindja buku-bakmaraŋal bitjarr, “Wanha? Yakan ŋarra marŋgi. Nhä ŋarra nhanŋu djägamirr?”   
\p
\v 10 Bala Garraynydja waŋan bitjarrnha, “Nhaku nhe dhuwal djäma yätjkurrnydja mirithirrnydja? Nhuŋuny yukuyuku'mirriŋu maŋgu munatha'ŋurnydja wäthurr ŋarraku, rirrakaynydja ŋunhi ŋarra ŋäkul bitjanarawnha bunharawnha yaŋara-bakmaranharawnha.  
\v 11 Dhipuŋurnydja dhurrwaraŋur nheny dhu ga marin marram, ga bulu nhe dhu ga bäyŋun gätni djäma. Nhuŋuny yukuyuku'mirriŋuny maŋgu yuḏurrkthurr munathay warray, ŋunhi nhe bumar ŋanya, bitjan nhakun ŋuli dhurrwaray yuḏurrkthun.  
\v 12 Ŋuii nhe dhu birrka'yun ŋathany nhuŋuwuy nhe nhirrpan munatha'lilnydja, ŋayi nhuŋu dhu ga munathany miḏikirra yan; yakan nhuŋu buluŋuw bäkiw ŋamakurr. Bäyŋun nhuŋu manymaktja wäŋa; waṉḏirra yan nhe dhu ga buku-ḻiw'maraman.”   
\p
\v 13 Ga ŋayiny Caindja waŋan bitjarrnha Garraywal, “Dhuwaṉḏja dhä-gir'yunawuy ŋarraku nhokuŋ mirithirra gumurr-ḏälnha muka?  
\v 14 Dhuwaṉḏja nhe ŋarrany ga dhuḏi-ŋurrkaman dhipuŋurnha munatha'ŋurnha wäŋaŋur, ga bulu nhe ga ŋarrany ŋan'ŋaŋdhun nhokiyingalnha nhe goŋŋur. Ŋarra dhu ga marrtjin buku-liw'maraman dhuwalatjanna munatha'wurrnha wäŋamiriwnha. Ŋuli ŋarrany dhu ŋula yolthu bawalamirriy maḻŋ'maramany, walalnydja ŋarrany dhu buman yan.”  
\v 15 Yurr Godtja nhanŋu buku-bakmaraŋal waŋan bitjarr, “Bäyŋu. Ŋuli walal dhu ŋula yolthu nhuna bumany, ŋarrany dhu 7 walŋa marram nhunanhany walŋa yaŋara-bakmaram.” Bala ŋayi Garrayyuny Caingalnydja baldhurr'nha nhirrpar namban wäwunnha, märr ŋanya dhu ŋula yolthuny bawalamirriynydja guwatjman, ga yakan bumany.  
\v 16 Yurr Caindja waṉḏin Godkalaŋuŋur goŋŋur, bala ŋayi gan nhinanany ŋunhiliyin wäŋaŋurnydja yakuŋur “Waṉḏinyamirriŋura Buku-ḻiw'maranhamirriŋurnha”; ŋunhiyiny wäŋa gali-dhimurruŋura Yedannha.   
\s1 Cainguŋuny mala-bunhawuy (The Descendants of Cain)  
\sr Genesis 4.17-24  
\p
\v 17 Caindja gan nhinan, ga nhanŋu miyalk, ga yan bili ga yothu maṉḏaŋ dirramu dhawal-guyaŋan, bala maṉḏa yäku-nhirrparnydja ŋanya Enochnha. Ga Caindhuny gan buṉbu dhuḻ'yurr dharrwan mirithirra, yindikuŋal ŋayi wäŋanhan, ga yäku-nhirrparnydja ŋayi wäŋany ŋunhiyi bili yan Enoch.   
\p
\v 18 Ga Enochkuny gäthu'mirriŋu Irad, ga Iradtja bäpa'mirriŋu Mehujaelgu, ga Mehujaelgu gäthu'mirriŋu Methushael, ga Methushaelnydja bäpa'mirriŋu Lamechku.  
\v 19 Ga Lamechkuny märrma' miyalk, yäkun maṉḏa Adah ga Zillah.  
\v 20 Bala Adahwuŋuny dhawal-guyaŋanan ḏirramu yothu yäku Jabal. Ga Jabalnydja yolŋu yäku dhuwal mala-ŋurrkanhayŋu bukmakku yolŋu'yulŋuw ŋurikiwurruŋ-gun ŋunhi walal gan ŋuthanmaraŋal nha warrakan'nhan malaŋuny wiripuŋuny wiripuŋuny, ga ŋorranhany walal ŋuli ganha wiṉinŋur.  
\v 21 Ga nhanŋu yukuyuku'mirriŋuny yäku Jubal, ga ŋayi ŋunhi balanyayi linygu mala-ŋurrkanhayŋuyi bukmakku yolŋu'yulŋuw ŋurikiwurruŋgun ŋunhi walal gan buŋgulnha mala ŋayathaŋal, manikay, yiḏaki, biḻma, wiripu wiripu mala.  
\v 22 Ga Zillahwuŋuny yothu yäku Tubal Cain, ga ŋayiny gan Tubal Caindhuny djäma girri' malany djämapuy djimuku' balanyayi bili wiripu wiripu. Ga yapa'mirriŋu nhanŋu Tubal Caingu yäku Naamah.   
\p
\v 23 Ga Lamechtja waŋan nhanukiyingalaŋuwal miyalkkal maṉḏaŋgal bitjarr, “Maṉḏa Adah ga Zillah, buthuru-bitjurr maṉḏa ŋarraku:  
\p Ŋarrany dhuwal bumar dhiŋganhamaraŋal yutany ḏirramuny gurrmulnha, bili ŋayi ŋarrany wuṯthurr.   
\p
\v 24 Ga ŋuli dhu 7-dja walŋa marram Cainnhany yaŋara-bakmaram, ga 77-dja walŋa dhu marram, ŋarranhan yaŋara-bakmaram, ŋuli dhu ŋula yolthu yolŋuy ŋarranhany buma.” Bitjarr ŋayi waŋan.   
\s1 Sethkalaŋuwuy (Seth aṉḏ Enosh)  
\sr Genesis 4.25-26  
\p
\v 25 Adamdhu ga nhanukal miyalkthu wiripu yothu ḏirramu maḻŋ'maraŋal, bala ŋayi miyalktja waŋan bitjarr, “Godthuny ŋarrany dhuwal wiripun yothu ḏirramu gurrupar Abel wuŋuli', ŋunhi ŋayi ŋanya Caindhu wuṯthurr.” Bala ŋanya ŋayi miyalkthuny yäkuny nhirrpar Sethnha.  
\v 26 Ga Sethkuny gäthu'mirriŋu yäku Enosh. Ga balanyamirriyyiny waluy walal gan ŋurru-yirr'yurra yäku-lakaraŋal ŋanya Godnha garrkuḻuknha gänan, ŋuliwitjarrnydja buku-ŋal'yunawurrnydja yan.   
\c 5  
\s1 Mala-bunhawuy Adamguŋuny (The Descendants of Adam)  
\sr Genesis 5.21-24  
\p
\v 21 Ŋunhi ŋayi Enoch 65 mirriyinany dhuŋgarramirriyin, bala nhanŋu gäthu'-mirriŋuny maḻŋ'thurra yäku Methuselah-ny.  
\v 22 Ga dhäŋur beŋuryiny ŋayi Enochtja gan nhinan dhunupa ga galkin Godkala, ga waŋanhaminyany maṉḏa ŋuli ganha God ga ŋayi Enoch 300 waltjaṉ. Ga bulu nhakun ŋayi djamarrkuḻiny' märraŋal.  
\v 23 Ga nhinanany ŋayi gan 365 mirriyin ŋayi dhuŋgarramirriyin.  
\v 24 Bala ŋayi gan nhinanany bitjarrnha bili weyinnha galki Godkalnha, ga yan bili-i-i, bala ŋayi winya'yurra, bili ŋanya ŋayi Godthuny märraŋala.   
\c 6  
\s1 Noah  
\sr Genesis 6.9-22  
\p
\v 9-10 Dhuwaṉḏja dhäwu Noahwalaŋuwuy. Noah-w gäthu'mirriŋu ḻurrkun', yäku dhuwalawurr gam', Shem, Ham ga Japheth. Noah-wnydja ŋula nhä gämurru djarrpi' bäyŋu; ŋayi pi waŋgany gan nhinan ŋamakurrnydja yolŋu, ga bäyŋun ganha wiripuwurrnydja ŋamakurr yolŋu walal nhinanha dhiyal munatha'ŋur. Maṉḏa gan lakaranhaminany God ga Noah bala-räli'yunminany, dhunupa ga baḻanydjarratjarra, ŋula nhämiriw.   
\p
\v 11 Wiripuwurrnydja yolŋu walal gan walŋa nhinan yätjkurr maŋutjiŋur Godkal, ga bunhamirrnydja rom ga ŋoy-ŋapuny' walalaŋgalnydja gan ŋorran yan bawalamirriwal yolŋuwal walalaŋgal.   
\p
\v 12 Ga Godthuny nhäŋal wäŋanhany, bala ŋayi nhäŋalnha yätjkurrunhany, bili walal gan yolŋuny walal walŋany nhinan yätjkurr yan.   
\p
\v 13 Bala ŋayi Godtja bitjarrnha waŋan Noahwalnydja, “Bilin dhuwal ŋarrapiny ḻiya-ŋamaŋamayunminan bay, buwayakkunharawnha, ŋarra dhu buwayakkuman warrpam'thunna yolŋunhany walalany wäŋa-manapanna. Ŋarra walalany dhu buwayakkuman dhawar'maraman, bili dhiyaŋiyi ga bunhamirriy romdhu wäŋanhany miḏikuman.   
\p
\v 14 “Gatjuy dhuḻ'yurra nhuŋuwuy nhe mar-thaŋay'nhany manymakthun yan dharpaynydja, ga djäman mungurrnydja malany. ga bidi'yurr minyay marthaŋay'nhany djinawa ga warraŋul.  
\v 15 Djäma nhe dhu mirithirr weyin nambany 450, ga djakany 75, ga 45-tja mirithirr garrwar.  
\v 16 Djäma bukuny, ga yaka gunguŋ galiny'. Bala'palany ŋorranhawuynydja djäma ḻurrkun', yurr mirithirra weyinkurrnha, waŋganydja ŋoylil, ga waŋganydja gaṉḏarrlil, ga waŋganydja garrwarlilnha. Ga dhurrwarany djäma gali'lila.   
\m
\v 17 Ŋarrany dhu dhuwal buku-ḻupmaraman warrpam'thunna dhuwaṉḏja munatha'nhany wäŋany, buwayakkuman ŋarra dhu dhuwaṉḏja ŋunhi ŋula nhä mala ga walŋa nhina. Ŋula nhä mala dhu dhiyal munatha'ŋur dhiŋgaman warrpam'thunna,   
\m
\v 18 yurr ŋarra dhu dhuwal romdja nhirrpanna bay nhokalnha bunanhaminyawuynydja litjalaŋ. Gatjuy gärrin walal marthaŋay'lila, nhepi ga nhuŋu miyalk ga djamarrkuḻi nhuŋu ga miyalkkurruwurr walalaŋ.   
\m
\v 19-20 Gäŋun walalany nhokiyingalnha nhe marthaŋaylil warrakan'nhany malaŋuny; yurr waŋga'waŋganynha miyalktja märraŋ warrakan'nhany ga waŋga'-waŋganydhi yan dirramunhany warrakan'nha märraŋ. Nhä dhuwali ga barrkuwatj mala warrakan nhina, marrtjinyamirr ga buṯthunamirr; nhe dhu wapmaraman walalany, märr walal dhu ga nhina walŋa.  
\v 21 Märraŋ nhä malany ŋatha barrkuwatj nhumalaŋguwuy nhuma yolŋuw, ga warrakan'ku malaŋuw.” Ga bitjarr ŋayi gan Godthu waŋanany Noah-ny.  
\v 22 Bala gan Noah-ny malthurra ŋuriki bili yan dhärukkuny ŋunhi nhä mala ŋayi gan lakaraŋal nhanukal Godthu.   
\c 7  
\s1 Buku-iupmaranhawuy buwayakkunhawuy dhäwu (The Flood)  
\sr Genesis 7.11-24  
\p
\v 11 Ŋunhi ŋayi Noah 600 mirriyinany dhuŋgarramirriyin, bala gapuny munatha'ŋumydja ŋuwapthurra, bala dhurrwarany djiwarr'puynydja ḻapthurra,  
\v 12 bala waltjaṉdja yarrupthurra, dharyurra gan, 40 walu ga 40 munha.  
\v 13 Ga ŋuriŋi bili waluy walalnydja Noah ga nhanŋu miyalk ga ḻurrkun' djamarrkuḻi' maṉḏaŋ yäku Shem, Ham ga Japheth, ga miyalkkurruwurr walalaŋ, bukmaknha walal gärrinan marthaŋay'lila.  
\v 14 Ga bukmak ŋunhi nhä malany marrtjinyamirr warrakan, boḏiny ga wakinŋu, ḏilkurr ga yumurrku, ga ŋula nhä malany warrakan buṯthunamirr, walal marrtjin gärrinan marthaŋaylila.  
\v 15 Waŋga'waŋgany ḏirramu warrakan ga waŋga'waŋganydhi yan miyalktja warrakan, bukmak ŋula nhä malany ŋuli ganha ŋunhi ŋorranha dhiyal munatha'ŋur, bukmaknha walal gärrinan marthaŋaylila, malthurra Noah-wnha.  
\v 16 Ga ŋunhiyi bitjarryi Godthu lakaraŋal. Bala Garrayyun dhurrwarany gungaŋalnha dhäŋur Noahwalnydja gärrinyaŋur.   
\p
\v 17 Bala gapuny ŋuwapthurra 40 munhaynydja ga 40 waluynydja, bala marthaŋaynydja buwalkthurra.  
\v 18 Bala gapuny dhulmuthinan mirithinan, bala marrtjin marthaŋaynydja burkthurra garrwarnha ŋapaŋurnha gapuŋur.  
\v 19 Ga gapuny mirithinan dhulmuthin, ga waḏaŋga'-weyinnhany ŋunhi wäŋany warrpam'nha buku-ḻupmaraŋal.  
\v 20 Bala ŋal'yurra marrtjin gapuny mirithinan ga yan bili ga djuḻkmaraŋal ŋunhi bukuny.  
\v 21 Ŋula nhä malany ŋunhi ŋuli ganha ŋorranha dhiyal munatha'ŋur, warrpam'nha dhiŋgaŋalnha; warrakan buṯthunamirr ga gal'yunamirr ga marrtjinyamirr ga yolŋu'-yulŋu, warrpam'nha dhiŋga'-dhiŋgaŋal.   
\p
\v 22 Ŋula nhä malany dhiyal munatha'ŋur ŋir'yunamirr, warrpam'nha dhiŋgaŋal.  
\v 23 Garrayyu buwayakkuŋal ŋunhi nhä malany gan dhiyal munatha'ŋur ŋorran; yolŋuny ga warrakan'nha malany marrtjinyamirriny ga buṯthunamirriny. Yurr walŋathinany ŋunhiwurrnha bilin Noah-n ga ŋunhi nhä malany nhanŋu gan malthurr marthaŋayyu.   
\p
\v 24 Yurr gapuny bäyŋu yan ŋula ŋurru-yirr'yuna nyimdhunany; baḏak yan gan dhärran gapuny dhaŋaŋ, ga yan bili ga 150 walu ga munha djuḻkthurr.   
\c 8  
\s1 Buwayakkunhaŋurnydja gapu nyimdhurra (The End of the Flood)  
\sr Genesis 8.1,6-12,15-19  
\p
\v 1 Godthu Noahnhany bäyŋu monha, ga ŋunhi warrakan'nha malaŋuny ŋunhi walal gan malthurr nhanŋu marthaŋayyu: ŋayiny djäma wäŋi galkirrinya-maraŋal. bala gapuny ŋurru-yirr'yurra nyimdhurra marrtjin.  
\v 6 Dhäŋur 40 walu djuḻkthurr, bala ŋayi Noah-ynydja windany ḻapmaraŋalnha  
\v 7 bala ŋayi djuy'yurrnha warrakan'nhan yäkuny ravennha, balanyaranhan rumbalnha nhakun wäknha, yurr ŋunhiyi warrakan'tja yaka roŋiyinya, ŋuliwitjarra banydjin gan gapukurra yan buṯthurr, wirwiryurra gan yan ga yan bili ga wäŋa baŋdanydhin.  
\v 8 Ga ŋuriŋiyi bili yan waluy Noah-y djuy'yurr murryilnhan, ŋuriki gapuw nhänharaw nhaltjarra ŋunhi gapuny, baṉḏanydhinan, mak badak yan gan ŋapa-ŋäkirrin wäŋanhany gapuynydja.  
\v 9 Yurr gapuynydja gan badak yan ŋapa-dhurrthurryurr wäŋanhany, yurr bäyŋu ŋula murryilyu wäŋanhany maḻŋ'maranha nhinanharaw-nydja. Bala ŋayi roŋiyinan buṯthurr marthaŋaylila, bala Noah-ynydja ŋanya märraŋalnha marthaŋaylila.   
\p
\v 10 Ga yänayi Noah-ny galkurr 7 munha, ga buluyi ŋayi djuy'yurr ŋunhiyi linygu murryilnha.  
\v 11 Ga walu-gärrinyaraynha bala ŋayi murryilnydja gumurr-roŋiyinan, yurr dhä-man'tjarrmirra, ga yäkuny ŋunhi dharpany olive. Bala Noah-ny marŋgithinan ŋunhi gapuny warrpam'nha banḏanydhin.  
\v 12 Ga bulu ŋayi Noah galkurr 7 munha, ga buluyi nhakun ŋayi djuy'yurryi ŋunhiyi bili warrakan'nha murryilnha, ga ŋuriŋiyiny waluy ŋayi ŋunhiyi warrakan yakan roŋiyinya.  
\v 15 Bala Godtja waŋanan Noahwal bitjarrnha,  
\v 16 “Gatjuy dhawaṯthurra walal marthaŋayŋurnydja, nhepi ga miyalk nhuŋu ga djamarrkuli nhuŋu ga nhokalaŋaw djamarrkuḻiw' miyalkkurruwurr.  
\v 17 Gäŋun dhuwali warrakan'nhan malaŋuny marrtjinyamirriny ga buṯthunamirriny, märr walal dhu mala-buman ḻatjuwarr'maraman wäŋalila malaŋulil.”  
\v 18 Bala walal dhawayawaṯthurra Noah ga nhanŋu miyalk ga djamarrkuḻi nhanŋu ga djamarrkuḻiw' nhanukalaŋaw miyalkkurruwurr.  
\v 19 Bala gan ŋunhi warrakan'tja mala dhawa'ṯthurra buṯthunamirrnydja ga marrtjinya-mirrnydja, yurr malakurra malakurra walal gan marrtjinany.   
\s1 Noah-y gurrupar warrakan bathanawuy Godku mundhurr (Noah Offers a Sacrifice)  
\sr Genesis 8.20-22  
\p
\v 20 Noah-y dhuḻ'yurr guŋda warrakan'ku mundhurrwu bathanaraw, Garraywu gurrupanaraw. Ga wiripuny mala warrakan buṯthunamirr ga marrtjinyamirr garrkuḻuk Godkal maŋutjiŋur gurrupanaraw mundhurrwu, ga wiripuny mala warrakan bäyŋu garrkuḻuk bathanaraw, Godku gurrupanaraw mundhurrwu. Ga Noah-ynydja gan bumar ŋunhi nhä malany waŋga'waŋgany warrakan barrkuwatj garrkuḻuk, ga waŋgapunuŋalnydja ŋayi gan dhorru yan mundhurrnydja Godkuny gurrupanaraw. Ŋayi gan batharnydja ŋunhiliyi gundaŋur buku-weyinŋur.  
\v 21 Bala ŋayi Godthu nhumarnha ŋunhiyi warrakan'tja buŋgan, bala ŋayi goŋmirriyinan Garraynydja, ga waŋanhamin ŋanyapinya ŋayi bitjanmin, “Yakan ŋarra dhu bitjaṉḏhi buluny nyerawunum yätjkurruw maḻŋ'thunaraw dhiyakuny munatbawny'tja yolŋuwalnydja walalaŋgal yätjkurru-ŋur. Ŋarrany marŋgi nhanŋu yolŋuwnydja; beŋur waluŋur yutaŋur nhanŋu guyaŋanhawuynydja djarrpi' yan. Yakan ŋarra dhu buluny buwayakkum ŋunhi nhä malany ga nhina dhiyaŋ bala walŋa, nhakun dhiyaŋ bala waluy ŋarra buwayakkuŋal.  
\v 22 Dhipuŋurnydja dhurrwaraŋur ga yan bili ga dhä-dhawar'yunamirriy, wäŋany dhu ga dhuwal dhärran yan, ga ŋunhiyi dhu ga maḻŋ'thunna waluny mala dhunupan ŋathaw ḻämu-nhirrpanaraw ga gulkthuna-raw. Ga bitjanna bfli dhu ga guyiŋarryirra ga gorrmur'yirra, waltjaṉmirriyirra ga dharratharra-mirriyirra, walupuy ga munhawu.”   
\c 9  
\s1 Godkuŋ wäwun Noah-w (God's Covenant with Noah)  
\sr Genesis 9.1-6,8-17  
\p
\v 1 Bala ŋayi Godthuny Noahnhany dhunupan gumurrkuŋalnha ga dälkuŋalnha ga gäthu'mirriŋuny walalany nhanŋu, bala ŋayi waŋanan bitjarrnha walalaŋgal, “Gatjuy dharrwan djamarrkuḻi'nhany mala-buŋu ŋini, ga nhumalaŋguŋuny dhu ga djamarrkuḻi mirithirra dharrwan nhina bawalamirriŋura wäŋaŋur-nydja, buku-ḻiw'maraman dhu ga nhinany walal dhiyal munatha'ŋurnydja.  
\v 2 Ŋula nhä malany warrakan bukmak ga ŋarirri dhu ga barrarirra nhuŋu. Ga ŋunhiyiny mala dhu nhokalnydja ganydjarrŋur ŋoyŋura.   
\p
\v 3 Dhipuŋurnydja dhurrwaraŋur nhe dhu ga jukan walalany warrakan'nhany malaŋuny ga ŋarirrinhany, ga buiu nhe dhu ga ḻuka dharpapuy borum mala ga ŋatha mala. ŋarrany nhuna ga dhuwal gurrupanna ŋula nhä malany ḻukanharawnydja.  
\v 4 Yurr waŋganydja nhuma dhu yaka ḻuka; ŋunhiny ŋunhi ga maŋgu badak ŋorra ŋanakŋur. ŋarra ga dhuwal nhumalaŋ yaka'yundja, bili maŋguny' ŋunhi walŋa yan.  
\v 5 ŋula yolthu dhu yolŋuy wiripuŋuny buma, ŋanyanhany ŋarra dhu dhä-gir'yunna. ŋarrany dhu dhä-gir'yunna dhiŋganhamaraman ŋanya ŋula yolnha warrakan'nha waŋganynha ŋunhi dhu ŋayi yolŋunhany walŋa djaw'yiin rakunygum.  
\v 6 Godthu djäma yolŋunhany balanya bili yan nhakun ŋayipi God, ga ŋuia yolthu dhu yolŋuy buma murrkay'kum yolŋuny wiripuŋunhany, ŋanyanhany dhu bumayi dhiŋganhamaramdhi wiripuŋuynha yolŋuy.”  
\v 8 Bala Godtja waŋanan Noahwal ga nhanukalaŋuwal gäthu'mirriŋuwal walalaŋgal bitjarr,  
\v 9 “ŋarrany dhu dhuwal djäma ŋarrakuwuynha ŋarra romnha, gurrupanminyarawnha nhumalaŋgun ga nhumalaŋgalaŋawnha djamarrkujjw',  
\v 10 ga bukmakku warrakan'ku malaŋuw nhä mala ga dhuwali nhina. ŋarrany djäman dhuwaṉḏja rom gurrupanminyarawnha bukmakkun ŋurikin ŋunhi gan marthaŋayŋur dhawaṯthurr, ga malthurr nhuŋu walal gan.   
\p
\v 11 Märraŋ dhuwal dhäruk. Dhäruktja dhuwal rom gurrupanminyawuynydja nhokalnha: Dhuwal ŋarra ga wäwundja nhirrpanna: ŋarra dhu yakan buluny buku-ḻupmaram ga buwayakkum ŋunhi nhä mala ga dhiyal nhina dhiyaŋ bala. Bäyŋun dhu ŋarra buluny buku-ḻupmaram ga buwayakkum dhuwaṉḏja wäŋa munatha'nhany. Dhuwaṉḏja ga rom barraŋga'yun weyinŋuwnha nhinanharaw.  
\v 12 Ga dhuwaṉḏja baldhurr' ŋarra ga djäma nhuŋun ga ŋula nhaku malaŋuw dhuwali ga nhina:  
\v 13 Ŋarrany dhu djäri rulwaŋdhun ŋarrakuwuy ŋarra maŋanlil. Dhuwal djäri baldhurr' ŋarraku rom gurrupanminyawuy, ŋorran dhu ga bukmakkalnha.  
\v 14 Ŋunhi ŋarra dhu ga bitjan bili djiwarr'nhany dhurrthurryun maŋaṉḏhun, bala ŋayi dhu ga djäriny dhawaṯthunna yan,  
\v 15 ga ŋuriŋiyi dhu ga ŋarranhany guyaŋanhamirryam, ŋunhi ŋarra wäwunguŋal nhumalany ga bukmaknha warrakan'nha, yakan dhu buluny buku-ḻupmaram ga buwayakkum ŋula nhänhany malany ŋunhi dhuwal ga nhina.   
\p
\v 16 Yo, ŋunhi dhu ga djäriny dhawaṯthunna yan, ŋarrany bala dhu ga nhäman ga guyaŋan roŋiyirra ŋunhi ga rom barraŋga'yun weyinŋuwnha nhinanharaw, ŋunhiyi rom ŋarrakuŋ, ŋula nhakun malaŋuw bukmakkun ŋunhi ga nhina dhiyal munatha'ŋur.  
\v 17 Dhuwaliymy baldhurr' dhawu' ŋarra djäma ŋula nhaku malaŋuw yan bukmakku ŋunhi ga nhina dhuwali munatha'ŋur.”   
\c 11  
\s1 Babylondja wäŋaŋur yäkuŋur yolŋuy walal gan djäma ḻiya-weyin bala' (The Tower of Babylon)  
\sr Genesis 11.1-9  
\p
\v 1 Ŋäthilnydja ŋunhi waluy, ŋurru-yirr'yunamirriynydja, bukmakpuy wäŋapuy yolŋu walal gan waŋan waŋgany yan matha; walal gan bäkiny ŋunhi bili yan waŋganygurr dhärukkurr.   
\p
\v 2 Walal gan marrtjinany warrya'yurra wäŋakurrnydja gali-dhimurrukurra, ga yan bili gan bunan walal ŋunhiliyiny wäŋaŋur ŋapa-wajakurrŋurnha, ŋarakaŋur wäŋaŋur yäkuŋur Babyloniany. Bala walal nhinanan ŋunhiliyiny wäŋayaŋalnha.   
\p
\v 3 Bala walal gan waŋanhaminan bala-räli'yunminan bitjanminan, “Go limurr walal djäman munatha'nhany guŋdakuman, ga gorrmur'kumany limurr dhu gurthaynha dälkumany.” Bitjarr walal waŋanhaminany. Bala walal gan djäman dharrwan guŋdany, ga minyany walal gan ŋayathaŋal dharrwayi yan.   
\p
\v 4 Bala walal waŋanan bitjarrnha, “Go limurr bukmaknha dhu balany' dhui'yun, ga waŋganydja limurr dhu dhui'yun mirithirra djaka'-weyinnha, garrwarnydja dhu ŋunha ŋayatham.” Walal gan guyaŋanany mirithinan, yäkun yindikunhamin walalanhawuynha walal garramatkunhaminany ŋuliwitjarryiny buŋbukurr Mya-weyin'kurrnydja dhui'yunawurr. “Dhiyaŋuny dhu gay'yi Nya-weyin'thun buŋbuy waŋgany-manapaṉḏja ŋilimurruny, märr limurr dhu yakan iatjuwarr'yundja ga barrkuwatjthirrnydja.” Ga bitjarr walal gan waŋanhaminany.  
\v 5 Ga ŋunhi ŋayi Garraynydja yarrupthurr ŋunhiwiliyi wäŋalil nhänharaw ŋurikiyi wäŋaw malaŋuw ga bulu ŋuriki buŋbuw Mya-weyin'ku, ŋunhi walal gan yolŋu'yulŋuy dhui'yurr ŋunhiliyi.  
\v 6 Bala ŋayi Godtja waŋanan bitjarrnha, “Nhä dhuwaṉḏja? Waŋgany mala ga yan yolŋu nhina, ga waŋa walal ga yan waŋgany matha. Dhuwaṉḏja walalaŋguŋ yan ŋurru-yirr'yunawuy djäma, ga nhäny walal dhu djäma buluny? Yalalany walal dhu mirithirra marŋgithirr djämaw, bala walal dhu djäman bukmak nhaku walal djäl.  
\v 7 Go limurrnydja yarrupthunna bala mel-manapanna dhäruknha barrkuwatjkuman, märr walal dhu ga yakan dharaŋanmirrnydja bala-räli'yunmirr.”  
\v 8 Bala ŋayi Godthu gulkmaraŋalnha latjuwarr'maraŋalnha yolŋunhany malaŋuny wäŋalila malaŋulil bawalamirrilila munatha'lil, bala walal ḏaḏawyurra ŋuliŋurnydja yindiŋurnydja djämaŋur, ŋunhi walal gan dhuḻ'yurr wäŋa mala.  
\v 9 Ga wäŋa yäku ŋunhiyi yindi Babylon, bili ŋunhiliyin wäŋaŋurnydja ŋayi Godthu mel-manaparnydja barrkuwatjkuŋalnydja mathany mala yolŋuwnydja walalaŋ bukmakku yan, ga bulu ŋayi Godthu ḻatjuwarr'maraŋalnydja yolŋunhany walalany bawalamirrilila wäŋalil.   